// #69: the frame stats are off for a new user (no panel); Preferences › Interface › Frame stats
// shows the frame rate line alone, or the whole panel (long system names cut at its edge). The
// systems are timed, as with the *Time systems* preference.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    profile_cpu: true,
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("01-off"),
        Custom("frame-stats fps"),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("02-fps-line"),
        Custom("frame-stats details"),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("03-profile-clipped"),
        Custom("frame-stats off"),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("04-off-again"),
    ],
)
